sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client<br/>(Dashboard/CLI)
    participant RBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant API as eval-hub API<br/>8080/TCP
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MLflow as MLflow Tracking<br/>5000/TCP HTTPS
    participant Init as eval-runtime-init<br/>(Init Container)
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Adapter as Evaluation Adapter<br/>(lm-eval-harness)
    participant Sidecar as eval-runtime-sidecar<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant Model as Model Endpoint<br/>HTTPS
    participant OCI as OCI Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client, OCI: Flow 1: Evaluation Job Execution (Cluster Mode)

    Client->>RBAC: POST /api/v1/evaluations/jobs<br/>HTTPS/8443, Bearer Token
    RBAC->>API: Forward with X-Tenant, X-User headers<br/>HTTP/8080
    API->>K8s: Create Job + ephemeral Secret<br/>HTTPS/443, SA token
    API->>MLflow: Create Experiment & Run<br/>HTTPS/5000, Bearer token
    API-->>Client: 202 Accepted (Job ID)

    Note over Init, S3: Init Container Phase

    K8s->>Init: Start init container
    Init->>S3: Download test data<br/>HTTPS/443, AWS credentials
    S3-->>Init: Test data artifacts
    Init-->>K8s: Exit (data in /test_data volume)

    Note over Adapter, OCI: Evaluation Phase

    K8s->>Adapter: Start evaluation adapter
    K8s->>Sidecar: Start sidecar (KEP-753)

    loop For each benchmark
        Adapter->>Sidecar: POST model inference<br/>HTTP/localhost:8080
        Sidecar->>Model: Forward with API key injection<br/>HTTPS, ref-token resolved
        Model-->>Sidecar: Inference response
        Sidecar-->>Adapter: Response

        Adapter->>Sidecar: POST /api/v1/evaluations/jobs/{id}/events<br/>HTTP/localhost:8080
        Sidecar->>API: Forward benchmark status<br/>HTTPS/8443, SA token
        API-->>Sidecar: ACK
        Sidecar-->>Adapter: ACK

        Adapter->>Sidecar: POST MLflow run data<br/>HTTP/localhost:8080
        Sidecar->>MLflow: Log metrics/params<br/>HTTPS/5000, Bearer token
        MLflow-->>Sidecar: ACK
        Sidecar-->>Adapter: ACK
    end

    Adapter->>Sidecar: Push eval card<br/>HTTP/localhost:8080
    Sidecar->>OCI: PUT manifest + blobs<br/>HTTPS/443, Bearer token (challenge)
    OCI-->>Sidecar: 201 Created
    Sidecar-->>Adapter: ACK

    Note over Client, OCI: Flow 2: MCP Agent Interaction

    participant Agent as AI Agent / IDE
    participant MCP as evalhub-mcp<br/>3001/TCP

    Agent->>MCP: POST /mcp (JSON-RPC)<br/>HTTP/3001, X-User/X-Tenant
    MCP->>API: submit_evaluation tool call<br/>HTTP/8080, Bearer token
    API-->>MCP: Job created response
    MCP-->>Agent: MCP tool result

    loop Poll job status
        Agent->>MCP: get_job_status tool call
        MCP->>API: GET /api/v1/evaluations/jobs/{id}
        API-->>MCP: Job status + benchmark progress
        MCP-->>Agent: Status update
    end
